{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>עוכר ביתו</b> — In his folly he inherits wind and vapor, and the fool's servant belongs to the wise of heart as an inheritance, for he will acquire him from him. He indicates that the fool destroys his acquisitions, and the wise acquires them through his wisdom; or the fool is a servant to the wise."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:15.235807240Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}